Alkesh Kumar vs State Of U.P. And Another on 14 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/8542205/
2 (iii) The applicant shall not, directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer;
(iv) The applicant shall file an undertaking to the effect that he shall not seek any adjournment on the dates fixed for evidence and the witnesses are present in court.
